  "body": "A rare opportunity presents itself for sale for the very first time on the market since 1984, at 7a Musick Point Road. \r\n\r\nAn opportunity for all to take advantage of, whether it's the circa 1000m2 block, the Macleans College or Bucklands Beach Intermediate school zoning, the 30 second walk to the beach, the privacy, the option to develop with both services onsite (STCA) or perhaps you are looking for it all, then this property is a must see!\r\n\r\nThe current home is a whopping 5 bedroom, 2 bathroom, double story house. Upstairs is home to the primary kitchen, semi open to a dedicated dining area which easily flows out to the wrap around deck, encapsulating glimpses of the Sky Tower and ocean vistas of Buckland Beach. A large central living room makes the heart of the upstairs floorplan, 3 double bedrooms, a bathroom and a separate toilet complete the upstairs.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, perfect for larger, growing families, has 2 more bedrooms, another bathroom, the homes second full size living/dining space and a complete kitchenette. The perfect hideaway for extended family, older relatives, or busy teenagers, the options are endless.\r\n\r\nThe homes surrounds are a mix of level concrete areas, landscaped gardens and even a quaint Petanque pitch, or 'sandpit' for the younger family members. \r\n\r\nThe world really is your oyster at 7a Musick Point road with countless options, only limited by your imagination. Positioned perfect for a life well lived, only backed up by its current 42 year ownership.\r\n\r\nIf this sounds like a property you shouldn't miss, contact Chris today to organise a private inspection or visit through one of our open homes.",
